<title>USA: Vermont Muni Bank $24 mln repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>Vermont Muni Bank $24 mln repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Vermont Municipal Bond Bank's $23.6 million bond deal, raising yields in several maturities and lifting the top yield in 2017 to 5.40 percent from 5.35 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
